# LAN profile drop-in — rendered by build-image.sh from
# deploy/appliance/lan/icn-member-shell-30-lan-origin.conf.in when
# ICN_APPLIANCE_LAN_PROFILE=1.
#
# Rebinds the static member-shell server to 127.0.0.1:8090 (the demo unit
# binds 0.0.0.0:8090). In the LAN profile nginx serves the SAME static tree
# (/usr/share/icn/static/web) directly, so this server is not on the LAN
# browser path at all — it exists only for smoke-local parity. Keeping it on
# 0.0.0.0 would needlessly expose a second HTTP listener on the LAN, so the
# single-origin posture rebinds it to loopback. ExecStart is reset then
# re-set (systemd requires the reset to replace the inherited ExecStart).
[Service]
ExecStart=
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 -m http.server 8090 --bind 127.0.0.1 --directory /usr/share/icn/static/web
